hat IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"Swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/searchDictationBehavior(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/searchDictationBehavior(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/searchdictationbehavior(_:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","title":"searchDictationBehavior(_:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"searchDictationBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI26TextInputDictationBehaviorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TextInputDictationBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}]}}}